<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan Jan 1997 oil output down 1.2 pct on Dec.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan Jan 1997 oil output down 1.2 pct on Dec.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's January production of crude oil and gas condensate fell to 2.11 million tonnes from 2.14 million in December 1996, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It gave the following data for oil, oil products and gas production --</p>
<p>					Jan '97	 Dec '96    Jan '96</p>
<p> Crude oil (million tonnes)    2.11	   2.14	 1.80</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	     -1.2	   +5.1	  n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	    +17.4	  +12.1	  n/a</p>
<p>Natural Gas</p>
<p>  (billion cubic metres)	 0.68	   0.66	 0.58</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	     +3.3	  +11.3	  n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	    +18.3	   +2.3	  n/a</p>
<p> GASOLINE (tonnes)	    106,600	143,000    194,500</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	    -25.5	  -15.1	  n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	    -45.2	  -36.3	  n/a</p>
<p> DIESEL (tonnes)		195,900	209,000    237,800</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	     -6.3	  -16.6	  n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	    -17.6	  -30.4	  n/a</p>
<p> FUEL OIL (tonnes)	    344,200	330,300    322,700</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	     +4.2	   +0.3	  n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	     +6.7	  -15.9	  n/a</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
